  "<span class=\"c-accent\">s<sub>{@0}</sub> = {@1}</span> · ln 2 ≈ {@2} · skutočná chyba {@3} ≤ a<sub>{@4}</sub> = 1/{@5} ≈ {@6}": "<span class=\"c-accent\">s<sub>{@0}</sub> = {@1}</span> · ln 2 ≈ {@2} · 실제 오차 {@3} ≤ a<sub>{@4}</sub> = 1/{@5} ≈ {@6}",
  "<span class=\"c-accent\">vrstevnica x²/4 + y² = {@0}</span> · elipsa s poloosami a = 2√c ≈ {@1} a b = √c ≈ {@2}": "<span class=\"c-accent\">등위선 x²/4 + y² = {@0}</span> · 반축이 a = 2√c ≈ {@1}, b = √c ≈ {@2}인 타원",
