  "Vypočítaj nevlastný integrál $\\displaystyle\\int_0^{1}\\frac{{@0}}{{@1}}\\,dx$.": "이상적분 $\\displaystyle\\int_0^{1}\\frac{{@0}}{{@1}}\\,dx$를 계산하세요.",
  "Vypočítaj nevlastný integrál $\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\infty} x\\,\\mathrm{e}^{{@0}}\\,dx$.": "이상적분 $\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\infty} x\\,\\mathrm{e}^{{@0}}\\,dx$를 계산하세요.",
